>About

You are looking at the `*desktop browser`* target of the Thicket firmware. It
shares the renderer, the parser and the framebuffer with the device, one
implementation built for two targets.

>>Why it exists

 A change-rebuild-browse loop with no flashing, and a way to read the frozen
 page corpus without a radio.

